{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04594","headline":"闻雨 · 张说","name":"闻雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"多雨绝尘事，寥寥入太玄。\n城阴疎复合，檐滴断还连。\n念我劳造化，从来五十年。\n误将心徇物，近得还自然。\n闲居草木侍，虚室鬼神怜。\n有时进美酒，有时泛清弦。\n声真不世识，心醉岂言诠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}